# Tests

- Mock HTTP with `respx` and the `mock_config` fixture in `tests/conftest.py`. Do not read or write `~/.weezdom`.
- Command tests: `click.testing.CliRunner` against `weezdom_cli.cli.main`. Copy `tests/test_commands_query.py`. Authoring: `tests/test_commands_ontology_author.py`.
- Contract tests in `tests/test_integration_contract.py` assert method, path, `X-API-Key`, `X-Graph-Id`, and body. Update them when a request shape changes.
- Fake keys only (`wdm_testkey12345678`).
- `tests/test_live_smoke.py` stays skipped unless `RUN_LIVE=1` and `WEEZDOM_BASE_URL` is set. It is the staging check, not the default suite. It does not default to production. If `WEEZDOM_BASE_URL` is unset, the live tests skip. A production host is refused. Staging is `https://weezdomai-staging.up.railway.app`.
- New fakes are copied from a real API sample and keep that sample's call pattern. See **Spec gates (v3, 2 Nov)** in `AGENTS.md`.
- Show each new test fail on a wrong build and pass on the right one. See **Spec gates (v3, 2 Nov)** in `AGENTS.md`.
